# Rating-run output: battle logs are large and regenerable, and the fitted file is copied
# into the bot deliberately rather than committed here.
ratings/

# The replay corpus the human-policy fit and the sleep/freeze work were calibrated against:
# 67MB of downloaded battles, regenerable and not ours to redistribute. Anchored with a leading
# slash: a bare `data/` would also match `battle_sim/data/`, which is package data and belongs here.
/data/

# Run output from the tournaments, A/B comparisons and evaluator fits. All of it is produced by
# `tools/`, all of it is reproducible from a seed, and the numbers that matter are committed as
# `battle_sim/data/` or copied into the bot instead.
ab_match.json
ag_team_elo.json
ag_team_elo.txt
ag_teams.txt
ag_tournament.log
evaluator_compare.json
evaluator_fit.json
hazard_ab.json
overnight_elo.json
overnight_elo.txt
overnight_elo.games.jsonl
